      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Florida Southern Railway arrived in 1886, sparking rapid growth and leading Arcadia to incorporate the next year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arcadia%2C_Florida",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Arcadia’s historic district, featuring homes like the Johnson‑Smith House, is listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
